# Persistent state + caches (D11)
# data/ holds runtime stats written by local dev runs; never needed in
# the image. The .gocache/.gomodcache dirs are created by debian/rules
# (export GOCACHE/GOMODCACHE) and would bloat the build context.
data/
.gocache/
.gomodcache/
*.log

